{{!-- context: recipientName, agencyName, platformName, actionUrl --}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">Hi {{recipientName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">{{agencyName}} declined your request</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Nothing has changed on your account, and they have no access to it.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151;">
  If you think this was a mistake, check the Partner ID with them and send the request again.
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 24px;">
  {{> actionButton url=actionUrl label="Go to brand settings →"}}
</div>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">— The {{platformName}} team</p>
